# Allowlist: the Dockerfile copies only these paths, and the repo root holds
# ~750 MB of local-only state (.claude, .venv, .git, data) that would otherwise
# be uploaded to the builder on every deploy.
*

!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!getgather/
!getgather/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# Build artifacts inside the allowed trees
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
